# Line endings are pinned so that a checkout is byte-identical on Windows and
# macOS. Verification depends on this: `rustfmt.toml` sets `newline_style = "Unix"`,
# and the CI toolchain step parses `rust-toolchain.toml` with a line-anchored
# expression that a CRLF checkout would break.
#
# `actions/checkout` does not configure `core.autocrlf`, so without this file the
# working-tree line endings would depend on each runner image's ambient Git
# configuration.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary and archive types must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.onnx binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
*.a binary
